  "job_B15.8.2_20260920_210327": {
    "chunk_text": "Huic vero terre ad acent prate ubi dicitur hreodham.In IIII locis.In uno loco XVII agros on eastan And on su\u00f0an tucincgn\u00e6s. And on w\u00e6stan culinga gem\u00e6re. And on nor\u00f0an, et in alio loco XII agros. On eastan is culinga gem\u00e6re & on su\u00f0an clifwara gem\u00e6re. And on westan. And on nor\u00f0an, et in tertio loco VII agros be eastan. Is mearcfleot. And be su\u00f0an. And be westan & be nor\u00f0an is clifwara gemere et in quarto loco sex agros. Be eastan is clifwara gem\u00e6re. And be su\u00f0an is culinga gem\u00e6re. And be westan is & be nor\u00f0an clifwara gem\u00e6re. Brom geh\u00e6ges boc.",
